#   python tools/fetch_index_history.py --underlying SENSEX --from 2023-01-01
# NOTE: tools/dhan_bulk_history.py used to write a permanent ".csv.empty" sentinel on
# a TRANSIENT empty response, silently discarding 522 of 9,760 NIFTY series (5.3%).
# That is fixed (verified_empty + retry). Recover old sentinels with:
#   python tools/recover_empty_series.py
